# EcoTrack

- Next.js 14 App Router + TypeScript under `src/`
- Tailwind + shadcn/ui; Zustand persist for entries
- Parse NL via `/api/parse` (OpenAI or heuristic). Never block logging if the LLM is down.
- Jest + RTL for components/utils
- Spanish UI; English code
- Replit: `.replit`, `replit.nix`, no extra setup; secrets via env
